+@t2 = internal global i8* bitcast([2 x [2 x i32]]* @e1 to i8*)
+@p3 = internal global i8* bitcast([2 x i32]* @a to i8*)
+@t3 = internal global i8* bitcast([2 x [2 x i32]]* @e to i8*)
