+
+declare <4 x float> @llvm.x86.sse41.blendvps(<4 x float>, <4 x float>, <4 x float>) nounwind readnone
+
+declare <8 x i16> @llvm.x86.sse41.packusdw(<4 x i32>, <4 x i32>) nounwind readnone
